$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Ground";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Avicord's Planet" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Hazy" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> are seperated by a huge chasm. The only thing connecting the two from the baron land between is a bridge. Grab the enemies flag and survive the Chasm to be victorious! Special Thanks to Server for the Idea of Spawning inside a vehicle!";